## Concept → Block Mapping

When translating user requests or high-level intent to Puck blocks, use this mapping:

| User Intent | Puck Block(s) |
|-------------|---------------|
| Hero / banner | `Hero` |
| Feature cards | `Grid` + `Card` |
| Statistics | `Stats` |
| Data table | `TableBlock` |
| Single record | `DataBlock` + Field blocks |
| Login form | `LoginBlock` |
| CTA button | `Button` |
| Navigation | `LinkBlock` |
| Spacing | `Space` |
| Title | `Heading` |
| Body text | `Text` |
| Logos | `Logos` |
| Data entry | `FormBlock` |
| Charts | `ChartBlock` |
| Rich text | `EditorBlock` / `MarkdownBlock` |
| Conditional | `ConditionalBlock` |

