## templateData Structure

Every page has this structure:

```json
{
  "root": {"props": {"title": "Page Title"}},
  "content": [
    {"type": "BlockName", "props": {...}},
    {"type": "BlockName", "props": {...}}
  ],
  "zones": {}
}
```

### Block Props Examples

**Hero:**
```json
{"type": "Hero", "props": {
  "title": "Main Headline",
  "description": "Subheadline text",
  "buttons": [{"text": "Get Started", "href": "/signup"}],
  "backgroundImage": "optional-url"
}}
```

**Grid with children in zones:**
```json
{"type": "Grid", "props": {"columns": 3, "gap": 4}}
// Children go in zones: "Grid-abc123:children": [...]
```

**Heading:**
```json
{"type": "Heading", "props": {"text": "Section Title", "level": "h2", "align": "center"}}
```

**Text:**
```json
{"type": "Text", "props": {"text": "Paragraph content here", "align": "left"}}
```

**Button:**
```json
{"type": "Button", "props": {"label": "Click Me", "variant": "primary"}}
```

**Card:**
```json
{"type": "Card", "props": {"title": "Feature Name", "description": "Feature description"}}
```

